  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: <a href=\"/tag/jupiter+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jupiter Hospital</a>, Thane, said it had successfully performed the world's first <a href=\"/tag/robotic+kidney+transplant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">robotic kidney transplant</a> surgeries outside China using the CE-certified <a href=\"/tag/toumai+robotic+surgical+system\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Toumai robotic surgical system</a> from <a href=\"/tag/microport+medbot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MicroPort MedBot</a>.The Toumai robotic platform provided high-definition, three-dimensional visualisation with enhanced dexterity, precision and surgical control, supporting the surgical team in performing the highly complex transplant procedures, the hospital said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The two consecutive transplants were carried out on patients with end-stage kidney disease, both of whom recovered well after surgery, the hospital added.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The procedures were led by senior transplant surgeon Dr. P. P. Rao, along with robotic kidney transplant surgeon Dr. Lokesh Sinha and the multidisciplinary transplant team.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                     